<http://example.org/isbn-1606996894> a rdac:C10007 ;
    rdfs:label "Sucker Bait and other stories / illustrated by Graham Ingels; written by Al Feldstein with Ray Bradbury. – First Fantagraphics Books edition. – Fantagraphics Books, [2014]" ;
